{"engine":"faster-whisper small.en (int8, CPU)","language":"en","segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":2.68,"text":"Look at the power button on whatever you're holding right now.","words":[["Look",0.0,0.44,0.797],["at",0.44,0.56,0.998],["the",0.56,0.7,0.995],["power",0.7,0.96,0.982],["button",0.96,1.26,0.994],["on",1.26,1.44,0.984],["whatever",1.44,1.68,0.985],["you're",1.68,1.94,0.982],["holding",1.94,2.16,0.998],["right",2.16,2.36,0.985],["now.",2.36,2.68,0.997]]},{"start":3.02,"end":7.5,"text":"A circle with a little gap at the top and a vertical line poking right through it.","words":[["A",3.02,3.1,0.98],["circle",3.1,3.5,0.997],["with",3.5,3.76,0.97],["a",3.76,3.92,0.99],["little",3.92,4.1,0.998],["gap",4.1,4.36,0.999],["at",4.36,4.52,0.993],["the",4.52,4.64,0.999],["top",4.64,4.94,0.999],["and",4.94,5.42,0.604],["a",5.42,5.6,0.991],["vertical",5.6,5.92,0.998],["line",5.92,6.34,0.998],["poking",6.34,6.6,0.998],["right",6.6,6.94,0.992],["through",6.94,7.18,0.997],["it.",7.18,7.5,0.996]]},{"start":7.92,"end":11.8,"text":"Phones, laptops, consoles, the TV remote on your couch.","words":[["Phones,",7.92,8.22,0.975],["laptops,",8.7,9.06,0.948],["consoles,",9.64,9.96,0.967],["the",10.58,10.62,0.939],["TV",10.62,10.86,0.94],["remote",10.86,11.12,0.997],["on",11.12,11.3,0.998],["your",11.3,11.44,0.998],["couch.",11.44,11.8,0.998]]},{"start":12.26,"end":15.76,"text":"The tech industry couldn't even agree on what shape a wall outlet should be.","words":[["The",12.26,12.5,0.994],["tech",12.5,12.7,0.994],["industry",12.7,13.06,0.999],["couldn't",13.06,13.42,0.998],["even",13.42,13.6,0.994],["agree",13.6,13.9,0.998],["on",13.9,14.04,0.997],["what",14.04,14.2,0.996],["shape",14.2,14.44,0.96],["a",14.44,14.58,0.979],["wall",14.58,14.9,0.987],["outlet",14.9,15.22,0.989],["should",15.22,15.44,0.998],["be.",15.44,15.76,1.0]]},{"start":16.06,"end":21.8,"text":"And yet somehow, every company on earth agreed to put the same tiny drawing on everything we own.","words":[["And",16.06,16.18,0.973],["yet",16.18,16.32,0.989],["somehow,",16.32,16.86,0.851],["every",17.22,17.54,0.991],["company",17.54,17.8,0.999],["on",17.8,18.1,0.999],["earth",18.1,18.4,0.574],["agreed",18.4,18.78,0.994],["to",18.78,18.98,0.998],["put",18.98,19.1,0.998],["the",19.1,19.24,0.99],["same",19.24,19.64,0.999],["tiny",19.64,20.08,0.978],["drawing",20.08,20.44,0.998],["on",20.44,20.66,0.998],["everything",20.66,21.18,0.991],["we",21.18,21.5,0.997],["own.",21.5,21.8,0.976]]},{"start":22.8,"end":27.48,"text":"Except, if you look inside the official international rulebook where this symbol was born,","words":[["Except,",22.8,23.28,0.973],["if",23.62,23.72,0.992],["you",23.72,23.86,0.999],["look",23.86,24.06,0.999],["inside",24.06,24.4,0.997],["the",24.4,24.6,0.996],["official",24.6,25.1,0.965],["international",25.1,25.62,0.776],["rulebook",25.62,26.24,0.755],["where",26.24,26.44,0.939],["this",26.44,26.62,0.97],["symbol",26.62,26.86,0.997],["was",26.86,27.06,0.998],["born,",27.06,27.48,0.998]]},{"start":27.48,"end":30.46,"text":"there's a second version sitting right next to it.","words":[["there's",27.48,28.12,0.642],["a",28.12,28.34,0.992],["second",28.34,28.6,0.987],["version",28.6,28.96,0.997],["sitting",28.96,29.24,0.994],["right",29.24,29.66,0.992],["next",29.66,29.92,0.999],["to",29.92,30.12,0.999],["it.",30.12,30.46,0.998]]},{"start":30.56,"end":34.02,"text":"Where the circle is completely closed, trapping the line inside.","words":[["Where",30.56,30.72,0.918],["the",30.72,30.9,0.995],["circle",30.9,31.12,0.988],["is",31.12,31.4,0.997],["completely",31.4,31.92,0.994],["closed,",31.92,32.62,0.998],["trapping",33.02,33.12,0.984],["the",33.12,33.38,0.998],["line",33.38,33.56,0.996],["inside.",33.56,34.02,0.993]]},{"start":34.56,"end":38.78,"text":"That closed circle is the actual legally recognized on-off symbol.","words":[["That",34.56,34.82,0.99],["closed",34.82,35.24,0.984],["circle",35.24,35.66,0.984],["is",35.66,35.92,0.966],["the",35.92,36.12,0.995],["actual",36.12,36.62,0.976],["legally",36.62,37.16,0.704],["recognized",37.16,37.78,0.917],["on",37.78,38.16,0.746],["-off",38.16,38.36,0.678],["symbol.",38.36,38.78,0.995]]},{"start":39.22,"end":44.26,"text":"And the reason companies stop printing it on your gadgets is because nothing you own actually turns off anymore.","words":[["And",39.22,39.34,0.973],["the",39.34,39.44,0.992],["reason",39.44,39.62,0.999],["companies",39.62,40.04,0.99],["stop",40.04,40.3,0.839],["printing",40.3,40.64,0.999],["it",40.64,40.82,0.98],["on",40.82,40.92,0.998],["your",40.92,41.08,0.997],["gadgets",41.08,41.48,0.998],["is",41.48,41.82,0.671],["because",41.82,42.08,0.994],["nothing",42.08,42.42,0.996],["you",42.42,42.64,0.996],["own",42.64,42.94,0.998],["actually",42.94,43.34,0.971],["turns",43.34,43.68,0.998],["off",43.68,43.94,0.996],["anymore.",43.94,44.26,0.947]]},{"start":45.32,"end":49.32,"text":"Back in 1973, selling electronics globally was a headache.","words":[["Back",45.32,45.48,0.993],["in",45.48,45.66,0.998],["1973,",45.66,46.64,0.995],["selling",47.04,47.38,0.993],["electronics",47.38,47.9,0.998],["globally",47.9,48.3,0.99],["was",48.3,48.74,0.99],["a",48.74,48.98,0.999],["headache.",48.98,49.32,0.998]]},{"start":50.02,"end":56.9,"text":"Shipping the same machine to Germany, France and Japan meant stamping different metal faceplates with local words for on and off.","words":[["Shipping",50.02,50.14,0.938],["the",50.14,50.36,0.998],["same",50.36,50.62,0.999],["machine",50.62,50.92,0.997],["to",50.92,51.1,0.996],["Germany,",51.1,51.52,0.999],["France",51.8,52.1,0.999],["and",52.1,52.36,0.435],["Japan",52.36,52.76,0.999],["meant",52.76,53.2,0.894],["stamping",53.2,53.72,0.995],["different",53.72,54.08,0.998],["metal",54.08,54.36,0.997],["faceplates",54.36,54.94,0.932],["with",54.94,55.16,0.994],["local",55.16,55.42,0.998],["words",55.42,55.82,0.995],["for",55.82,56.04,0.993],["on",56.04,56.4,0.776],["and",56.4,56.64,0.96],["off.",56.64,56.9,0.999]]},{"start":56.9,"end":61.34,"text":"So, an international standards group replaced words with two simple shapes.","words":[["So,",56.9,57.62,0.653],["an",57.74,57.84,0.984],["international",57.84,58.3,0.742],["standards",58.3,58.92,0.995],["group",58.92,59.2,0.993],["replaced",59.2,59.64,0.995],["words",59.64,59.96,0.82],["with",59.96,60.26,0.996],["two",60.26,60.56,0.975],["simple",60.56,60.96,0.988],["shapes.",60.96,61.34,0.999]]},{"start":61.78,"end":64.62,"text":"A vertical line for on and a hollow circle for off.","words":[["A",61.78,61.9,0.957],["vertical",61.9,62.18,0.993],["line",62.18,62.44,0.996],["for",62.44,62.64,0.995],["on",62.64,62.94,0.463],["and",62.94,63.34,0.403],["a",63.34,63.46,0.981],["hollow",63.46,63.72,0.988],["circle",63.72,64.12,0.994],["for",64.12,64.34,0.994],["off.",64.34,64.62,0.997]]},{"start":65.14,"end":68.58,"text":"You still see them on the heavy plastic switch on the back of a desktop computer.","words":[["You",65.14,65.3,0.991],["still",65.3,65.52,0.991],["see",65.52,65.74,0.996],["them",65.74,65.88,0.995],["on",65.88,66.0,0.99],["the",66.0,66.12,0.96],["heavy",66.12,66.32,0.989],["plastic",66.32,66.74,0.967],["switch",66.74,67.08,0.995],["on",67.08,67.28,0.977],["the",67.28,67.38,0.999],["back",67.38,67.58,0.999],["of",67.58,67.72,0.996],["a",67.72,67.86,0.984],["desktop",67.86,68.12,0.993],["computer.",68.12,68.58,0.999]]},{"start":69.16,"end":74.46,"text":"Flip it to the circle and a metal spring physically snaps open inside, cutting the wire to the wall.","words":[["Flip",69.16,69.38,0.986],["it",69.38,69.5,0.981],["to",69.5,69.6,0.997],["the",69.6,69.72,0.997],["circle",69.72,70.06,0.995],["and",70.06,70.48,0.568],["a",70.48,70.6,0.989],["metal",70.6,70.8,0.988],["spring",70.8,71.16,0.995],["physically",71.16,71.7,0.987],["snaps",71.7,72.2,0.992],["open",72.2,72.54,0.997],["inside,",72.54,73.02,0.993],["cutting",73.38,73.56,0.999],["the",73.56,73.72,0.999],["wire",73.72,73.92,0.995],["to",73.92,74.1,0.997],["the",74.1,74.22,0.999],["wall.",74.22,74.46,0.999]]},{"start":75.18,"end":78.88,"text":"When engineers started building single push buttons that toggled both ways,","words":[["When",75.18,75.32,0.997],["engineers",75.32,75.7,0.994],["started",75.7,76.1,0.992],["building",76.1,76.46,0.998],["single",76.46,76.94,0.997],["push",76.94,77.24,0.982],["buttons",77.24,77.56,0.783],["that",77.56,77.78,0.995],["toggled",77.78,78.2,0.948],["both",78.2,78.44,0.98],["ways,",78.44,78.88,0.991]]},{"start":79.22,"end":82.08,"text":"they combined the two shapes into that closed circle.","words":[["they",79.22,79.4,0.982],["combined",79.4,79.82,0.995],["the",79.82,80.02,0.995],["two",80.02,80.24,0.996],["shapes",80.24,80.6,0.999],["into",80.6,80.86,0.993],["that",80.86,81.16,0.995],["closed",81.16,81.58,0.996],["circle.",81.58,82.08,0.997]]},{"start":82.08,"end":87.68,"text":"By rule, you can only print that symbol on a switch that completely severs power from the wall.","words":[["By",82.08,82.86,0.534],["rule,",82.86,83.16,0.944],["you",83.5,83.52,0.991],["can",83.52,83.66,0.994],["only",83.66,84.0,0.995],["print",84.0,84.26,0.997],["that",84.26,84.5,0.968],["symbol",84.5,84.84,0.976],["on",84.84,85.02,0.995],["a",85.02,85.2,0.993],["switch",85.2,85.36,0.968],["that",85.36,85.62,0.986],["completely",85.62,86.14,0.985],["severs",86.14,86.66,0.988],["power",86.66,86.98,0.997],["from",86.98,87.26,0.993],["the",87.26,87.4,0.994],["wall.",87.4,87.68,0.997]]},{"start":88.48,"end":90.16,"text":"Then came the wireless remote control.","words":[["Then",88.48,88.52,0.953],["came",88.52,88.76,0.979],["the",88.76,88.94,0.961],["wireless",88.94,89.36,0.977],["remote",89.36,89.7,0.996],["control.",89.7,90.16,0.996]]},{"start":90.7,"end":92.28,"text":"Think about how a TV remote works.","words":[["Think",90.7,90.76,0.985],["about",90.76,90.96,0.997],["how",90.96,91.12,0.993],["a",91.12,91.32,0.994],["TV",91.32,91.6,0.978],["remote",91.6,91.92,0.997],["works.",91.92,92.28,0.999]]},{"start":92.82,"end":95.68,"text":"When you click it from your couch at midnight, the TV wakes up.","words":[["When",92.82,92.9,0.99],["you",92.9,93.04,0.999],["click",93.04,93.22,0.995],["it",93.22,93.34,0.992],["from",93.34,93.46,0.995],["your",93.46,93.6,0.995],["couch",93.6,93.82,0.999],["at",93.82,94.02,0.997],["midnight,",94.02,94.38,0.999],["the",94.74,94.8,0.994],["TV",94.8,95.1,0.998],["wakes",95.1,95.38,0.998],["up.",95.38,95.68,0.999]]},{"start":96.24,"end":101.42,"text":"For the TV to see that invisible beam of light, a sensor inside the TV has to stay awake,","words":[["For",96.24,96.34,0.995],["the",96.34,96.48,0.998],["TV",96.48,96.7,0.997],["to",96.7,96.88,0.997],["see",96.88,97.16,0.999],["that",97.16,97.34,0.987],["invisible",97.34,97.8,0.996],["beam",97.8,98.14,0.999],["of",98.14,98.3,0.999],["light,",98.3,98.56,0.998],["a",98.96,99.08,0.988],["sensor",99.08,99.38,0.991],["inside",99.38,99.94,0.999],["the",99.94,100.14,0.996],["TV",100.14,100.4,0.999],["has",100.4,100.7,0.997],["to",100.7,100.9,0.999],["stay",100.9,101.08,0.999],["awake,",101.08,101.42,0.999]]},{"start":101.86,"end":104.06,"text":"watching the room 24 hours a day.","words":[["watching",101.86,102.1,0.997],["the",102.1,102.32,0.998],["room",102.32,102.58,0.999],["24",102.58,103.28,0.877],["hours",103.28,103.6,0.984],["a",103.6,103.86,0.997],["day.",103.86,104.06,1.0]]},{"start":104.54,"end":109.74,"text":"Which means even when you've turned the TV off, the circuit board inside is still live with electricity.","words":[["Which",104.54,104.74,0.99],["means",104.74,104.94,0.998],["even",104.94,105.3,0.755],["when",105.3,105.48,0.997],["you've",105.48,105.68,0.956],["turned",105.68,105.82,0.994],["the",105.82,105.98,0.996],["TV",105.98,106.26,0.998],["off,",106.26,106.76,0.913],["the",107.24,107.38,0.995],["circuit",107.38,107.7,0.998],["board",107.7,107.88,0.992],["inside",107.88,108.26,0.998],["is",108.26,108.52,0.995],["still",108.52,108.82,0.999],["live",108.82,109.14,0.924],["with",109.14,109.36,0.993],["electricity.",109.36,109.74,0.999]]},{"start":110.54,"end":115.86,"text":"You can't stamp a total disconnect symbol on a machine with live voltage running inside it.","words":[["You",110.43,110.74,0.506],["can't",110.74,111.08,0.993],["stamp",111.08,111.34,0.992],["a",111.34,111.5,0.99],["total",111.5,111.94,0.894],["disconnect",111.94,112.5,0.979],["symbol",112.5,112.96,0.974],["on",112.96,113.16,0.981],["a",113.16,113.26,0.989],["machine",113.26,113.56,0.996],["with",113.56,113.8,0.99],["live",113.8,114.16,0.933],["voltage",114.16,114.68,0.986],["running",114.68,114.9,0.964],["inside",114.9,115.28,0.993],["it.",115.28,115.86,0.987]]},{"start":116.48,"end":118.14,"text":"For, you know, safety reasons.","words":[["For,",116.48,116.76,0.511],["you",116.94,117.02,0.866],["know,",117.02,117.14,0.999],["safety",117.56,117.66,0.984],["reasons.",117.66,118.14,0.998]]},{"start":118.88,"end":121.6,"text":"So, companies grabbed a different symbol from the rulebook instead.","words":[["So,",118.88,118.94,0.979],["companies",119.34,119.34,0.928],["grabbed",119.34,119.64,0.99],["a",119.64,119.86,0.995],["different",119.86,120.22,0.996],["symbol",120.22,120.54,0.991],["from",120.54,120.76,0.994],["the",120.76,120.88,0.994],["rulebook",120.88,121.2,0.798],["instead.",121.2,121.6,0.954]]},{"start":122.26,"end":124.9,"text":"The broken circle with the line sticking halfway out.","words":[["The",122.26,122.28,0.834],["broken",122.28,122.62,0.85],["circle",122.62,123.08,0.995],["with",123.08,123.48,0.375],["the",123.48,123.6,0.941],["line",123.6,123.82,0.84],["sticking",123.82,124.14,0.995],["halfway",124.14,124.48,0.854],["out.",124.48,124.9,0.997]]},{"start":125.58,"end":127.9,"text":"Originally, it wasn't called the power symbol at all.","words":[["Originally,",125.58,125.76,0.974],["it",126.06,126.16,0.993],["wasn't",126.16,126.46,0.998],["called",126.46,126.64,0.996],["the",126.64,126.82,0.968],["power",126.82,127.14,0.839],["symbol",127.14,127.48,0.994],["at",127.48,127.64,0.989],["all.",127.64,127.9,1.0]]},{"start":128.32,"end":130.22,"text":"Its official name was Standby.","words":[["Its",128.32,128.46,0.726],["official",128.46,128.86,0.997],["name",128.86,129.12,0.999],["was",129.12,129.44,0.997],["Standby.",129.44,130.22,0.634]]},{"start":130.98,"end":135.3,"text":"Once companies realized they didn't have to physically cut the power, everything changed.","words":[["Once",130.98,131.18,0.992],["companies",131.18,131.56,0.995],["realized",131.56,132.02,0.92],["they",132.02,132.26,0.975],["didn't",132.26,132.56,0.999],["have",132.56,132.72,0.998],["to",132.72,132.92,0.998],["physically",132.92,133.26,0.998],["cut",133.26,133.56,0.998],["the",133.56,133.72,0.998],["power,",133.72,134.0,0.999],["everything",134.44,134.74,0.991],["changed.",134.74,135.3,0.998]]},{"start":135.3,"end":141.06,"text":"Today, even when you shut down an iPhone, it keeps battery power running to its tracking and payment chips.","words":[["Today,",135.3,136.06,0.75],["even",136.42,136.6,0.992],["when",136.6,136.78,0.994],["you",136.78,136.94,0.997],["shut",136.94,137.12,0.853],["down",137.12,137.32,0.994],["an",137.32,137.5,0.989],["iPhone,",137.5,137.88,0.966],["it",138.18,138.22,0.978],["keeps",138.22,138.46,0.994],["battery",138.46,138.78,0.978],["power",138.78,139.12,0.994],["running",139.12,139.44,0.996],["to",139.44,139.7,0.986],["its",139.7,139.84,0.9],["tracking",139.84,140.22,0.992],["and",140.22,140.44,0.995],["payment",140.44,140.68,0.993],["chips.",140.68,141.06,0.976]]},{"start":141.58,"end":147.4,"text":"And on a Windows PC, clicking restart actually shuts your computer down more completely than clicking shutdown.","words":[["And",141.58,141.68,0.969],["on",141.68,141.82,0.976],["a",141.82,142.0,0.995],["Windows",142.0,142.24,0.98],["PC,",142.24,142.72,0.98],["clicking",143.26,143.4,0.987],["restart",143.4,144.0,0.338],["actually",144.0,144.62,0.954],["shuts",144.62,144.94,0.992],["your",144.94,145.12,0.995],["computer",145.12,145.4,0.998],["down",145.4,145.68,0.996],["more",145.68,145.94,0.983],["completely",145.94,146.44,0.986],["than",146.44,146.74,0.972],["clicking",146.74,147.08,0.996],["shutdown.",147.08,147.4,0.619]]},{"start":148.4,"end":154.4,"text":"By 2004, the Standby icon was on so many main switches that engineers officially gave up,","words":[["By",148.4,148.56,0.987],["2004,",148.56,149.38,0.989],["the",149.78,149.88,0.993],["Standby",149.88,150.46,0.612],["icon",150.46,150.86,0.786],["was",150.86,151.08,0.998],["on",151.08,151.24,0.997],["so",151.24,151.6,0.99],["many",151.6,151.86,0.999],["main",151.86,152.12,0.986],["switches",152.12,152.44,0.983],["that",152.44,152.76,0.923],["engineers",152.76,153.18,0.995],["officially",153.18,153.78,0.992],["gave",153.78,154.08,0.998],["up,",154.08,154.4,1.0]]},{"start":154.86,"end":157.74,"text":"rewrote the rulebook to say the broken circle just means power,","words":[["rewrote",154.86,155.12,0.983],["the",155.12,155.3,0.998],["rulebook",155.3,155.64,0.789],["to",155.64,155.82,0.996],["say",155.82,156.0,0.998],["the",156.0,156.16,0.724],["broken",156.16,156.46,0.721],["circle",156.46,156.76,0.995],["just",156.76,157.02,0.988],["means",157.02,157.32,0.998],["power,",157.32,157.74,0.895]]},{"start":158.02,"end":160.14,"text":"and added a crescent moon for sleep mode.","words":[["and",158.02,158.28,0.998],["added",158.28,158.56,0.998],["a",158.56,158.7,0.996],["crescent",158.7,159.06,0.978],["moon",159.06,159.34,0.996],["for",159.34,159.62,0.997],["sleep",159.62,159.84,0.958],["mode.",159.84,160.14,0.998]]},{"start":160.94,"end":166.52,"text":"We swipe, click, and tap that broken circle every single day, trusting it to kill the power.","words":[["We",160.8,161.06,0.712],["swipe,",161.06,161.46,0.996],["click,",161.74,161.98,0.992],["and",162.24,162.36,0.986],["tap",162.36,162.66,0.995],["that",162.66,162.9,0.965],["broken",162.9,163.18,0.998],["circle",163.18,163.58,0.994],["every",163.58,164.14,0.98],["single",164.14,164.52,0.962],["day,",164.52,164.9,0.999],["trusting",165.32,165.56,0.993],["it",165.56,165.8,0.996],["to",165.8,165.94,0.998],["kill",165.94,166.06,0.996],["the",166.06,166.22,0.995],["power.",166.22,166.52,0.995]]},{"start":166.96,"end":172.04,"text":"But that tiny gap at the top is the physical proof that our machines never really go to sleep.","words":[["But",166.96,167.24,0.993],["that",167.24,167.42,0.965],["tiny",167.42,167.82,0.997],["gap",167.82,168.1,0.997],["at",168.1,168.26,0.986],["the",168.26,168.42,0.995],["top",168.42,168.64,0.999],["is",168.64,168.88,0.975],["the",168.88,169.08,0.993],["physical",169.08,169.44,0.996],["proof",169.44,169.8,0.996],["that",169.8,170.04,0.99],["our",170.04,170.14,0.992],["machines",170.14,170.48,0.997],["never",170.48,170.98,0.995],["really",170.98,171.38,0.953],["go",171.38,171.62,0.995],["to",171.62,171.78,0.998],["sleep.",171.78,172.04,0.999]]},{"start":172.5,"end":176.98,"text":"Which is a lot scarier in a world where everything in your living room is eavesdropping on you.","words":[["Which",172.5,172.66,0.989],["is",172.66,172.78,0.994],["a",172.78,172.86,0.991],["lot",172.86,173.12,0.975],["scarier",173.12,173.66,0.998],["in",173.66,173.82,0.984],["a",173.82,173.94,0.992],["world",173.94,174.12,0.999],["where",174.12,174.34,0.989],["everything",174.34,174.78,0.993],["in",174.78,175.04,0.995],["your",175.04,175.16,0.994],["living",175.16,175.38,0.999],["room",175.38,175.66,0.991],["is",175.66,175.9,0.995],["eavesdropping",175.9,176.48,0.997],["on",176.48,176.74,0.996],["you.",176.74,176.98,0.999]]},{"start":177.82,"end":180.6,"text":"Look, your power button's been lying to you for decades.","words":[["Look,",177.82,178.04,0.984],["your",178.34,178.56,0.979],["power",178.56,178.86,0.976],["button's",178.86,179.2,0.879],["been",179.2,179.32,0.996],["lying",179.32,179.64,0.996],["to",179.64,179.9,0.991],["you",179.9,180.02,0.998],["for",180.02,180.2,0.998],["decades.",180.2,180.6,0.98]]},{"start":181.26,"end":182.7,"text":"The subscribe button won't.","words":[["The",181.26,181.42,0.992],["subscribe",181.42,181.84,0.891],["button",181.84,182.24,0.998],["won't.",182.24,182.7,0.993]]},{"start":183.36,"end":184.64,"text":"Go take a look around the channel.","words":[["Go",183.36,183.66,0.989],["take",183.66,183.8,0.993],["a",183.8,183.94,0.998],["look",183.94,184.02,0.999],["around",184.02,184.22,0.997],["the",184.22,184.38,0.992],["channel.",184.38,184.64,0.997]]},{"start":185.26,"end":186.52,"text":"There's plenty more like this.","words":[["There's",185.26,185.56,0.993],["plenty",185.56,185.78,0.998],["more",185.78,186.04,0.999],["like",186.04,186.28,0.996],["this.",186.28,186.52,0.999]]},{"start":190.14,"end":191.1,"text":"Thanks for watching!","words":[["Thanks",190.14,190.48,0.006],["for",190.48,191.1,0.651],["watching!",191.1,191.1,0.938]]}]}